    "sub_title": "CCNA高等證照輔導課程",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "1. CCNAv8考試題目檢討與實務案例剖析\n2. CCNAv8上機實作考試實作與練習",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "高速網路",
    "sub_ename": "HIGH SPEED NETWORKS",
    "describe_ch": "該課程提供一個全面且非理論性的高速網路介紹與探索。本課程授課內容將清楚且完整地詳述提供各樣式多媒體資料傳輸之高效能網路技術、原理與相關知識。本課程也將依序檢視各項現階段廣為使用之?頻網路傳輸技術，從ADSL、ADSL2、ADSL2+、及DOSIS，到以光傳輸為主之SONET/SDH、NG-SONET、ATM、MPLS、WDM/DWDM、APON、SDN等，皆多加以著墨、討論。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides a comprehensive, non-theoretical introduction to high-speed and broadband networking. It clearly and thoroughly conveys the principles and the technical fundamentals of the high-performance technologies that enable the reliable delivery of media-rich voice, video, and data services. After a careful examination of ADSL/2/2+ and DOSIS technologies, this course reviews the optical network solutions based on SONET/SDH, NG-SONET, ATM, MPLS, WDM/DWDM, APON and SDN technologies.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生能具備兼具廣度與深度之高速網路通訊技術專業素養。",
      "describe_en": "Provide students in-depth knowledge and commonly used technologies in high speed networks."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生能設計、分析高速網路通訊系統暨技術，並使之俱備有研製所需之能力。",
      "describe_en": "Have students be capable of analyzing, designing, and developing high speed networks as well as systems."
    }
  ],
