  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CI02310",
    "sub_id": "31191",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. 授課作業: 55%</div>\n\n<div>2. 上機考試 (Open books)*3: 45%</div>\n\n<div>3. 課堂出席率:&nbsp;一節課點名未到, 扣總分2分</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. 學生上課、考試, 需遵守逢甲大學+授課教師規訂之目關事項\n2. 無任何特殊原因 (病假、事假、公假...), 請到校上課\n3. 請假必需出示具體證明 (如; 病假: 醫院開立收據、事假: 檢附家長同意書與家長手機號碼/公司開立之相關說明文件)",
    "course_pol_en": "1. During classes and examinations, students must abide by the relevant matters stipulated by Fengjia University + the instructors\n2. Please come to school without any special reason (sick leave, personal leave, public holiday...)\n3. Specific proof must be presented when applying for leave (for example; sick leave: receipt issued by the hospital, personal leave: parent consent form and parent mobile phone number/relevant documentation issued by the company are attached)",
    "course_rem": "1. 每節(小時)曠課, 扣總分2分\n2. 無任何特殊原因 (病假、事假、...), 請到校上課",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. 學生產生之程式不可抄襲它人作品;&nbsp;若發現, 其該項作業成績 =(成績)/(抄績人數)</div>\n\n<div>2. 學生作業可利用ChapGPT或上網查閱資完成之, 但必需要親自加以適當修改+完整註解, 方能完成指定功能+執行、繳交上傳&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. The programs generated by students cannot plagiarize other people&#39;s works; if found, the grade of the assignment = (grade)/(number of people who copied the grade)<br />\n2. Student assignments can be completed using ChapGPT or online search, but they must be modified appropriately and fully annotated in person in order to complete the designated functions, execute, submit and upload.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
